  "terrainName": "cqb-village",
  "description": "What: SHOWCASE 'Bridgehead' (docs/SHOWCASE_Scenarios.md \u00a71) - military training, AI on both sides (the trainees possess Blue men when they join). 'Blue Platoon' (3 squads x 4) marches to phase line RED (the open ground at (125,95)); a 2-man Red outpost stands at one of three places (variant); 6 Red defenders hold the crossroads (198,182) from H3 and H5; villagers (each 0.7) on Main Street. The phases are a CHAIN of objectives: Reach phase line RED -> (trigger) Clear the crossroads switched on + Blue ordered PlatoonAttack -> (trigger) Hold the crossroads switched on + Blue ordered PlatoonDefend -> 120 s later the Red QRF (8, macro forces/red-qrf) is inserted at @QrfFrom (east or west, variant) and ordered PlatoonAttack; 180 s after Hold a civilian car (macro inject/civilian-car) drives in along Main Street. The ease-off director cuts Red one tier when the Bridgehead score stays < 0.35 past 20 min (at most twice, 10 min apart); End = Hold achieved or 45 min. Judge: (1) Clear is Inactive until Reach is Achieved, Hold Inactive until Clear is Achieved; (2) the QRF exists ~120 s after Hold activated, at the variant's edge, running PlatoonAttack; (3) one variant twice = the same outpost place, QRF edge and villagers (rail ShowcaseBridgeheadTests); (4) the ease-off fires at most twice and Red's SideTiers reads -1 after it; (5) no Blue round hits a Blue man. Generated by scripts/gen-showcase-bridgehead.py."
 },
